# Project R8 keep rules. AGP combines every *.keep file in src/main/keepRules with the default Android
# rules (proguard-android-optimize.txt) and each library's own consumer rules — Room, WorkManager,
# Coil, Ktor, Firebase, Credential Manager and kotlinx.serialization all ship theirs, so nothing here
# repeats those. See https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules
#
# Verify after touching dependencies: `./gradlew :app:assembleDevRelease` must succeed with no
# "Missing class" errors (R8 writes the rules it wanted to build/outputs/mapping/<variant>/missing_rules.txt),
# then sign-in + sync + a set page on a *Release build — the Supabase row DTOs are the reflection hot spot.

# ---- Crashlytics: readable stack traces -------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep file + line numbers in the obfuscated APK (mapping.txt, uploaded by the Crashlytics plugin, maps
# the renamed classes back). The source-file attribute is replaced with a constant so it leaks nothing.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile
# Exception class names appear in crash titles — don't obfuscate them.
-keep public class * extends java.lang.Exception

# ---- kotlinx.serialization: the app's own @Serializable classes --------------------------------------
# supabase-kt decodes Postgrest rows with a reified `serializer<T>()`, which looks the serializer up at
# runtime (Companion.serializer()). The library's bundled rules cover its own types; these keep the
# lookup path for the app's DTOs (SyncCoordinator / SupabaseCatalogRepository / ValueContributionRepository
# / CurrencyConverter rows) while still letting R8 rename everything else.
-keepattributes *Annotation*, InnerClasses
-keepclassmembers @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class com.senniapp.brickwares.** {
    *** Companion;
    *** INSTANCE;
    kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...);
}
-if @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class com.senniapp.brickwares.**
-keepclassmembers class <1>$Companion {
    kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...);
}
-if @kotlinx.serialization.Serializable class com.senniapp.brickwares.**
-keep,allowobfuscation,allowoptimization class <1>$$serializer {
    *** INSTANCE;
}
